            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/6df9e70b31a5182109bf02df929d0f88.poster.avif?t=1786673975\" aria-label=\"That Was The Day My Whole World Changed.\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/6df9e70b31a5182109bf02df929d0f88.webm?t=1786673975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/6df9e70b31a5182109bf02df929d0f88.mp4?t=1786673975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Mina, an ordinary high school girl who stumbles upon a secret war in the shadows of society. After resonating with a doll named Ruka, you gain supernatural powers to aid you in the conflict against Puppets, inhuman beings who have been secretly pulling strings to manipulate the course of human history.<br><br>With no choice but to fight to protect yourself and those you care about, you're forced to join an organization specializing in the eradication of Puppets. <br><br>Yet... one question still remains--who is controlling the Puppets? And to what end?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/53950dfd2f99876a8bf6c2d666781a89.avif?t=1786673975\" alt=\"Key Features\" width=780 height=328 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/2a4c9510b0c9f3319c7f2eef13c5a0ac.avif?t=1786673975\" alt=\"Urban Fantasy\" width=780 height=414 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a dark story full of mysteries to uncover as you become embroiled in the shadow war out of public view and use your new powers to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/84599ee8ffaee41b916b3c174c740b42.poster.avif?t=1786673975\" aria-label=\"Action-Packed Drama\" width=780 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/84599ee8ffaee41b916b3c174c740b42.webm?t=1786673975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/84599ee8ffaee41b916b3c174c740b42.mp4?t=1786673975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drama unfolds as the shadow war spills into your daily life, affecting those you care for. Wield supernatural powers as you fight against the forces threatening you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/98aca6a4ae2b7526b045d2927c6c79c4.avif?t=1786673975\" alt=\"Yuri Romance\" width=780 height=414 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love blossoms on the battlefield as you fight alongside the other girls in situations similar to your own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/e7f218948e8f9e06d5fa52e6aa80eaf8.avif?t=1786673975\" alt=\"Fully Voiced\" width=780 height=414 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every girl is voiced, with an all-star voice cast that includes big names like Hanazawa Kana, Ise Mariya, Akesaka Satomi, Kitamura Eri, and many more!</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/6df9e70b31a5182109bf02df929d0f88.poster.avif?t=1786673975\" aria-label=\"That Was The Day My Whole World Changed.\" width=780 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/6df9e70b31a5182109bf02df929d0f88.webm?t=1786673975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/6df9e70b31a5182109bf02df929d0f88.mp4?t=1786673975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Mina, an ordinary high school girl who stumbles upon a secret war in the shadows of society. After resonating with a doll named Ruka, you gain supernatural powers to aid you in the conflict against Puppets, inhuman beings who have been secretly pulling strings to manipulate the course of human history.<br><br>With no choice but to fight to protect yourself and those you care about, you're forced to join an organization specializing in the eradication of Puppets. <br><br>Yet... one question still remains--who is controlling the Puppets? And to what end?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/53950dfd2f99876a8bf6c2d666781a89.avif?t=1786673975\" alt=\"Key Features\" width=780 height=328 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/2a4c9510b0c9f3319c7f2eef13c5a0ac.avif?t=1786673975\" alt=\"Urban Fantasy\" width=780 height=414 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a dark story full of mysteries to uncover as you become embroiled in the shadow war out of public view and use your new powers to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/84599ee8ffaee41b916b3c174c740b42.poster.avif?t=1786673975\" aria-label=\"Action-Packed Drama\" width=780 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/84599ee8ffaee41b916b3c174c740b42.webm?t=1786673975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/84599ee8ffaee41b916b3c174c740b42.mp4?t=1786673975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drama unfolds as the shadow war spills into your daily life, affecting those you care for. Wield supernatural powers as you fight against the forces threatening you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/98aca6a4ae2b7526b045d2927c6c79c4.avif?t=1786673975\" alt=\"Yuri Romance\" width=780 height=414 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love blossoms on the battlefield as you fight alongside the other girls in situations similar to your own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/549850/extras/e7f218948e8f9e06d5fa52e6aa80eaf8.avif?t=1786673975\" alt=\"Fully Voiced\" width=780 height=414 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every girl is voiced, with an all-star voice cast that includes big names like Hanazawa Kana, Ise Mariya, Akesaka Satomi, Kitamura Eri, and many more!</p>",
